              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सहायता — sahāytā — \"aid; assistance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कई देशों ने सहायता भेजी। kaī deśoṁ ne sahāytā bhejī. Many countries sent aid."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
