          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्वयंसेवक (svayaṁsevak) is a modern compound of Sanskrit svayam, \"oneself, of one's own accord\", and sevaka, \"a servant\" (Monier-Williams): someone who serves because they chose to."
