              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जुटना — juṭnā — \"to gather; to come together\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मदद के लिए स्कूल में सौ लोग जुटे। madad ke liye skūl meṁ sau log juṭe. A hundred people gathered at the school to help."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): वह भीड़ जुटी, vah bhīṛ juṭī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जुटना (juṭnā) is inherited from yuṭati, \"is joined\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 10496), the family of जोड़ना, to join. People जुटते हैं when they come together for one purpose."
            }
          ]
        },
